{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Hecke.IwahoriHecke","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Hecke.IwahoriHecke","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.FreeAlgebra","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.RingQuot","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic"],"declarations":18,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.IwahoriHecke.isUnit_σ","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.IwahoriHecke.isUnit_σ","kind":"theorem","line":133,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/IwahoriHecke.lean#L133-L134","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.IwahoriHecke.σUnit","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.IwahoriHecke.σUnit","kind":"def","line":124,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/IwahoriHecke.lean#L124-L131","doc":"**The generators are units (sorry-free).**  When `q` is invertible\neach `σ_i` is a unit of `H_n(q)` with inverse `σInv`; hence the braid\ngroup maps into `H_n(q)ˣ` (the Hecke representation of braids). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.IwahoriHecke.σInv_mul_σ","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.IwahoriHecke.σInv_mul_σ","kind":"theorem","line":117,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/IwahoriHecke.lean#L117-L122","doc":"`σ_i⁻¹ · σ_i = 1` when `q` is invertible (sorry-free). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.IwahoriHecke.σ_mul_σInv","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.IwahoriHecke.σ_mul_σInv","kind":"theorem","line":110,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/IwahoriHecke.lean#L110-L115","doc":"`σ_i · σ_i⁻¹ = 1` when `q` is invertible (sorry-free). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.IwahoriHecke.σInv","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.IwahoriHecke.σInv","kind":"def","line":105,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/IwahoriHecke.lean#L105-L108","doc":"The explicit inverse of a generator: `σ_i⁻¹ = q⁻¹·(σ_i - (q-1))`,\nread off the quadratic relation `σ_i(σ_i - (q-1)) = q`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.IwahoriHecke.σ_quadratic_factored","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.IwahoriHecke.σ_quadratic_factored","kind":"theorem","line":91,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/IwahoriHecke.lean#L91-L99","doc":"The quadratic relation in factored form: `(σ_i - q)(σ_i + 1) = 0`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.IwahoriHecke.σ_commute","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.IwahoriHecke.σ_commute","kind":"theorem","line":84,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/IwahoriHecke.lean#L84-L89","doc":"**The commutation relation holds in `H` (sorry-free):**\n`σ_i σ_j = σ_j σ_i` for `j + 2 ≤ i`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.IwahoriHecke.σ_braid","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.IwahoriHecke.σ_braid","kind":"theorem","line":76,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/IwahoriHecke.lean#L76-L82","doc":"**The braid relation holds in `H` (sorry-free):**\n`σ_i σ_{i+1} σ_i = σ_{i+1} σ_i σ_{i+1}`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.IwahoriHecke.σ_quadratic","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.IwahoriHecke.σ_quadratic","kind":"theorem","line":69,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/IwahoriHecke.lean#L69-L74","doc":"**The quadratic relation holds in `H` (sorry-free):**\n`σ_i² = (q - 1)·σ_i + q`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.IwahoriHecke.σ","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.IwahoriHecke.σ","kind":"def","line":66,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/IwahoriHecke.lean#L66-L67","doc":"The generator `σ_i ∈ H`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.IwahoriHecke.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.IwahoriHecke.mk","kind":"def","line":62,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/IwahoriHecke.lean#L62-L64","doc":"The canonical algebra map from the free algebra onto `H`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.IwahoriHecke.instAlgebra","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.IwahoriHecke.instAlgebra","kind":"instance","line":59,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/IwahoriHecke.lean#L59-L60","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.IwahoriHecke.instRing","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.IwahoriHecke.instRing","kind":"instance","line":56,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/IwahoriHecke.lean#L56-L57","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.IwahoriHecke","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.IwahoriHecke","kind":"def","line":48,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/IwahoriHecke.lean#L48-L50","doc":"The **Iwahori–Hecke algebra** `H_{n+1}(q)` of type `A_n`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.HeckeRel.commute","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.HeckeRel.commute","kind":"ctor","line":43,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/IwahoriHecke.lean#L43-L46","doc":"`σ_i σ_j = σ_j σ_i` for `|i - j| ≥ 2` (stated for `j + 2 ≤ i`; the\ngenerated congruence is symmetric). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.HeckeRel.braid","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.HeckeRel.braid","kind":"ctor","line":38,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/IwahoriHecke.lean#L38-L42","doc":"`σ_i σ_{i+1} σ_i = σ_{i+1} σ_i σ_{i+1}`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.HeckeRel.quadratic","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.HeckeRel.quadratic","kind":"ctor","line":35,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/IwahoriHecke.lean#L35-L37","doc":"`σ_i² = (q - 1)·σ_i + q`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.HeckeRel","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.HeckeRel","kind":"inductive","line":31,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/IwahoriHecke.lean#L31-L46","doc":"The defining relations of the type-`A` Iwahori–Hecke algebra on `n`\ngenerators, as a `RingQuot` relation on `FreeAlgebra K (Fin n)`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}